{"id": "q0340", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 16.85, "n_chunks": 17, "scores": [0.4737, 0.393, 0.3502, 0.4396, 0.432, 0.4075, 0.4256, 0.3672, 0.3626, 0.3653, 0.3964, 0.3668, 0.4528, 0.3419, 0.3164, 0.408, 0.3551], "eot_score": 0.3825, "eot_read_ms": 21, "reference_answer": "Algeria", "query": "Set up in 1954 as a merger of smaller groups, the Front de Libration Nationale fought a war for independence from France until 1962, when the French government signed a cease-fire agreement. The FLN became the only legal party in which country?", "transcript": "Set up in nineteen fifty four as a merger of smaller groups, the Front de Libération Nationale fought a war for independence from France until nineteen sixty two, when the French government signed a ceasefire agreement. The FLN became the only legal party in which country?", "mode": "local", "answer": "The Front de Libération Nationale became the only legal party in Algeria. After France granted independence to Algeria in 1962, following years of war and negotiations with the FLN, the organization took on a leading role in the new Algerian government.", "answer_ms": 1223}
{"id": "q0350", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 6.95, "n_chunks": 7, "scores": [0.4323, 0.4145, 0.3829, 0.508, 0.3285, 0.3149, 0.3632], "eot_score": 0.3611, "eot_read_ms": 21, "reference_answer": "Fire insurance", "query": "English economist and physician Nicholas Barbon helped to pioneer which type of insurance in 1666?", "transcript": "English economist and physician Nicholas Barbon helped to pioneer which type of insurance in 1666?", "mode": "local", "answer": "English economist and physician Nicholas Barbon helped to pioneer **insurance for shipping and trade risks** in 1666. His contributions were part of the early development of commercial insurance, particularly related to maritime ventures during a time when England was expanding its global trade. While not the sole inventor, Barbon's ideas supported the growth of risk-sharing mechanisms that laid the groundwork for modern insurance practices.", "answer_ms": 1886}
{"id": "q0359", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 3.7, "n_chunks": 4, "scores": [0.4382, 0.436, 0.4457, 0.3222], "eot_score": 0.5321, "eot_read_ms": 24, "reference_answer": "Delaware, Maryland, West Virginia, Ohio, New York, New Jersey", "query": "For a point each, name the 6 states surrounding Pennsylvania.", "transcript": "For a point each, name the six states surrounding Pennsylvania.", "mode": "local", "answer": "The six states surrounding Pennsylvania are New York, New Jersey, Delaware, Maryland, West Virginia, and Ohio.", "answer_ms": 531}
{"id": "q0364", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 5.96, "n_chunks": 6, "scores": [0.478, 0.5057, 0.4808, 0.3753, 0.3814, 0.5134], "eot_score": 0.7885, "eot_read_ms": 21, "reference_answer": "Edward G. Robinson", "query": "Whose playing of the part of Enrico Bandello in the film 'Little Caesar' brought him to stardom?", "transcript": "His playing of the part of Enrico Bandello in the film Little Caesar brought him to stardom.", "mode": "escalated", "relay": "Edward G. Robinson brought him to stardom for playing the part of Enrico Bandello in the film Little Caesar.", "expert_answer": "Edward G. Robinson.", "expert_latency_s": 1.35, "stall_ms": 27, "relay_ms": 599}
{"id": "q0381", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 5.03, "n_chunks": 6, "scores": [0.4194, 0.4454, 0.398, 0.4597, 0.6495, 0.3653], "eot_score": 0.7478, "eot_read_ms": 22, "reference_answer": "MARK", "query": "What first name is shared by Turner Prize winning artists Wallinger and Leckey?", "transcript": "What first name is shared by Turner Prize-winning artists Wallinger and Lecky?", "mode": "escalated", "relay": "The first name shared by Turner Prize-winning artists Wallinger and Leckie is Mark.", "expert_answer": "Mark.", "expert_latency_s": 1.97, "stall_ms": 23, "relay_ms": 450}
{"id": "q0387", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 3.92, "n_chunks": 4, "scores": [0.4019, 0.3865, 0.3909, 0.4039], "eot_score": 0.5457, "eot_read_ms": 22, "reference_answer": "OAKUM", "query": "Traditionally with what were the seams of wooden ships caulked?", "transcript": "Traditionally, with what were the seams of wooden ships caulked?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Traditionally, the seams of wooden ships were caulked with **caulking**, a process that involved filling the gaps between planks using materials like **cotton, hemp, or oakum**. Oakum—twisted strands of tarred hemp fiber—was commonly used because it became waterproof when saturated with pitch or tar. The caulker would drive the oakum into the seams and then apply hot pitch to seal them tightly, ensuring the ship remained watertight during voyages.", "answer_ms": 2447}
{"id": "q0392", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 4.45, "n_chunks": 5, "scores": [0.4692, 0.4792, 0.386, 0.4528, 0.4041], "eot_score": 0.7833, "eot_read_ms": 21, "reference_answer": "Christina Ricci", "query": "Who played the role of Kate Flax in the 1990 film Mermaids?", "transcript": "Who played the role of Kate Flax in the 1990 film Mermaids?", "mode": "escalated", "relay": "Christina Ricci played Kate Flax in the 1990 film *Mermaids*.", "expert_answer": "Christina Ricci played Kate Flax in the 1990 film *Mermaids*.", "expert_latency_s": 2.44, "stall_ms": 23, "relay_ms": 490}
{"id": "q0406", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 1.05, "n_chunks": 2, "scores": [0.2572, 0.3176], "eot_score": 0.5991, "eot_read_ms": 22, "reference_answer": null, "query": "What is Pickleball?", "transcript": "What is pickleball?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Pickleball is a fun and fast-paced paddle sport that combines elements of tennis, badminton, and table tennis. It is played on a court that is similar in size to a doubles tennis court but with a shorter non-volley zone known as the \"kitchen.\" The game uses a solid plastic or composite paddle and a perforated plastic ball designed to be lightweight and easy to control with paddles rather than hands alone—though players can use their bare hands only for serving at certain times during play under specific rules depending on format and level of play. Players hit the ball over a low net using their paddles, aiming to land it within the opponent's court boundaries so they cannot return it effectively. It typically involves rallies where players volley the ball back and forth until one side fails to make a legal return. Pickleball is popular among people of all ages due to its accessibility, relatively low impact, and strategic gameplay.", "answer_ms": 4949}
{"id": "q0415", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 1.91, "n_chunks": 2, "scores": [0.3563, 0.3962], "eot_score": 0.8112, "eot_read_ms": 22, "reference_answer": null, "query": "List five titles by Kevin Kwan.", "transcript": "List five titles by Kevin Kwan.", "mode": "escalated", "relay": "Sure! Here are five titles by Kevin Kwan. Crazy Rich Asians, China Rich Girlfriend, Rich People Problems, Sex and Vanity, and Lies and Weddings.", "expert_answer": "Five titles by Kevin Kwan:\n\n1. *Crazy Rich Asians*\n2. *China Rich Girlfriend*\n3. *Rich People Problems*\n4. *Sex and Vanity*\n5. *Lies and Weddings*", "expert_latency_s": 2.67, "stall_ms": 26, "relay_ms": 804}
